; A block whose one fix names its own geographic coordinate system, and no
; *cs out anywhere. cavern refuses a geographic *cs out, so the system the
; file names cannot double as the output.
*begin plateau
*cs LONG-LAT
*fix l1 105.0 27.1 100
*data normal from to tape compass clino
l1 l2 10 0 0
*end plateau
